Package: bvbrcGoldStd
Title: Gold-Standard Metadata for BV-BRC Bacterial Isolates
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Janani", "Ravi", , "janani.ravi@cuanschutz.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A versioned, provenance-preserving, human-reviewed gold-standard
    metadata resource for BV-BRC/NCBI bacterial isolate metadata (host,
    isolation source, and related fields), starting with Staphylococcus
    aureus and extending to ESKAPE pathogens. Supplies curated reference
    tables and (in progress) an evaluation harness for scoring automated
    metadata-harmonization pipelines against reviewed ground truth.
